Package: LongViewSC
Type: ShinyApp
Title: Interactive Visualisation of Gene and Isoform Expression in Long-Read Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Sefi Prawer
Maintainer: Sefi Prawer <sefi.prawer@unimelb.edu.au>
Description: LongViewSC is a Shiny application for interactive exploration of gene and
    isoform expression from long-read single-cell RNA-seq data. Users upload a Seurat
    object and optional GTF file to visualise UMAP projections, isoform expression,
    transcript structures, pseudobulk heatmaps, isoform proportions and expression
    trajectories across cell types or conditions.
